the recent covid-19 relief bill, where there&nbsp;
were some who were saying this is as simple as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:04.240
overriding the parliamentarian and putting&nbsp;
the 15 dollar minimum wage. Into the bill,&nbsp;&nbsp;

