but then it simply wouldn't have passed because&nbsp;
it doesn't it doesn't seem Democrats had the vote.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:13.680
I mean, obviously Obamacare was was bigger&nbsp;
and changed in a more systemic way. A lot of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:18.480
aspects of how the system worked. But sometimes&nbsp;
maybe people forget that there's still a lot of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:23.840
a lot of very centrist Democrats in the Senate.
There are it's the same exact problem today. I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:30.800
mean, and it's always those senators on the fringe&nbsp;
who have the leverage ultimately, and they have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:34.880
the leverage. Let's remember why they have the&nbsp;
leverage. I mean, obviously, if you if you're&nbsp;&nbsp;

