00:06:55.520 --> 00:07:00.720
the people who were in favor of reform, the&nbsp;
liberals, the progressives, they wanted this very&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:05.680
badly. I mean, this this was something getting&nbsp;
universal coverage or getting close to universal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:10.240
coverage. It was you know, it was in their DNA.&nbsp;
It's why they got elected to Congress in the first&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:15.040
place. And the more conservative Democrats, a&nbsp;
lot of them I mean, they were in favor of it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:18.320
but, you know, they were that passionate&nbsp;
about it and they they would have been OK&nbsp;&nbsp;

