something much, much smaller. And so,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:26.560
you know, in a game of chicken, you know, who&nbsp;
wins is the one who's willing to kind of let&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:32.000
it let it all go and fall off the cliff or&nbsp;
have the crash or whatever the analogy is.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:36.160
And, you know, the liberal Democrats in a&nbsp;
day weren't willing to let this thing die&nbsp;&nbsp;

